#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:7009
#: C/index.docbook:7009
msgid "Some words about bugs: Though Gnome Commander is relatively free from bugs and is a quite mature program, no programs will ever be totally bug free. New bugs can be introduced with new features, or through other programs and libraries it depends on, especially for development and testing versions. Quality bug reporting is very important and can be a very good help for the developers to make a better program."
